{"items":[{"id":"387684204","root":"387684204","user":{"id":"32441245","name":"DaDou13","avatar":"093bb6531a9c7f8cfb23822d"},"text":"这个图吗\r\n[img=图片]https://imgs.aixifan.com/content/2021_02_05/1.6125372331080043E9.gif[/img]","time":1612537238739,"floor":5,"likes":38,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":["f9dc0f860e9d29071f9a970e"],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":true,"replyPreview":[{"id":"387712368","root":"387684204","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"舒坦了[emot=acfun,1798/]","time":1612538502533,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"387687178","root":"387687178","user":{"id":"541323","name":"天然猪肉丸","avatar":"a0dae55a5b64818e16835f82"},"text":"我觉得这个歌很有内容\n我觉得这个歌很有内容，很有深意。开头唱的表现，男1的生活很无趣，忙忙碌碌却毫无意义，无意间地，男1遇到了男0。两人苍白的生活从此充满色彩和激情。然而就像太阳靠近水星，水星失去了空气没有了生命。\n副歌部分，两个人分开演绎却犹在合唱试图找到共鸣，像极了分手后的情侣一次次话语试探却仍无法回到过去。阐述了，男1和男0有了隔阂，虽然曾经如此深爱，却敌不过现实的无奈。\n太阳远离水星，水星停止窒息，它得到了救赎，也永远失去了太阳。\n水星记，灯哥白帝合作，神作当之无愧！\n","time":1612537379532,"floor":6,"likes":22,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":5,"hot":true,"replyPreview":[{"id":"387695652","root":"387687178","user":{"id":"224274","name":"小木冰川雪兔","avatar":"f7f388cea2ef8f40bfaac28e"},"text":"[emot=acfun,2017/]为什么是1和0正常不应该是男1男2嘛","time":1612537708970,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"387707251","root":"387687178","user":{"id":"541323","name":"天然猪肉丸","avatar":"a0dae55a5b64818e16835f82"},"text":"说明灯哥咖位比男1还大","time":1612538266616,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"小木冰川雪兔","replyToUserId":"224274","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"387707630","root":"387687178","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"这个